      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّيْطَانِيَّةُ</span></b>  <i>A certain sect of the extravagant
zealots of</i> [<i>the schismatics called</i>] <i>the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيعَة</span>; so
